WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.141 --> 00:00:01.700
- We have a photo of you here.

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:03.830
Can you tell me what's going on here?

00:00:03.830 --> 00:00:04.780
I need to know this photo.

00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:06.432
- Oh, yeah.
(audience laughing)

00:00:06.432 --> 00:00:08.390
(Kelly and Jennifer laughing)

00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:09.600
- [Jennifer] Yeah,

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:10.540
- [Kelly] I mean your hair-

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:11.700
- [Jennifer] So that's me

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:12.533
- [Kelly] You're so Texan.

00:00:12.533 --> 00:00:14.200
- [Jennifer] That's me
in all my Texas glory.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.950
Uh huh, yeah, and I was going to

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:18.750
a New Kids on the Block concert.

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:20.170
- Of course.

00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:21.180
- In a fringe jacket

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:22.013
that my mom made me,

00:00:22.013 --> 00:00:24.890
with my big Texas, y'know, Aqua Net hair.

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:28.250
And feeling myself, like I was really,

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:30.350
I mean I was really
feeling myself that day.

00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:33.080
And so I went to the
concert, and it was wonderful

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:34.130
because it was New Kids on the Block,

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:35.630
and I had the Joey McIntyre sheets

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:37.190
like all the girls in
the world at the time.

00:00:37.190 --> 00:00:39.160
And I'd sleep on the pillow
case with his face on it,

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:40.490
and just like love him.

00:00:40.490 --> 00:00:43.880
And I got to go backstage
(Kelly and audience laughing)

00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:46.450
right, like, at the back entrance,

00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:48.160
and scream with all the girls,

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:50.790
and I like reached out, like "Joey!",

00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:51.800
y'know like (screams).

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:54.460
And I reached out, and got
to touch him for a second,

00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:57.310
and he like, gave me
this like terrible look,

00:00:57.310 --> 00:01:00.110
like "crazy little girl get
off of me" kind of thing.

00:01:00.110 --> 00:01:02.182
And it broke my heart for years.

00:01:02.182 --> 00:01:03.040
- Aw...

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:06.020
- And then I got to meet
him later as a grown up,

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:07.040
and I told him that story,

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:08.780
and he gave me this gigantic hug.

00:01:08.780 --> 00:01:12.230
And he was like, "I'm so sorry.
It was such a crazy time."

00:01:12.230 --> 00:01:13.790
And he like fully just like

00:01:13.790 --> 00:01:16.500
sewed up this little tiny part of my heart

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:18.740
that had always been broken
by the New Kids on the Block.

00:01:18.740 --> 00:01:20.660
And I just love him for
it, and it was so cute.

00:01:20.660 --> 00:01:22.540
- Aw! That's amazing; that's so cool

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:24.150
that you had that
experience to walk up to him

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:26.323
and be like, "So, listen here.

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:28.273
You broke me."

00:01:28.273 --> 00:01:30.481
- I was like, I hold
onto things apparently.

00:01:30.481 --> 00:01:31.314
(Kelly and Jennifer laughing)

00:01:31.314 --> 00:01:32.980
- Well no it is funny what
happens when you're a kid.

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:34.510
What does stick. It's insane.

00:01:34.510 --> 00:01:36.280
Did you perform in Texas as a kid?

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:37.113
I did all the time.

00:01:37.113 --> 00:01:38.120
So did you do that?

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:42.230
- Oh yeah, I was um, I performed
a lot at Livestock shows.

00:01:42.230 --> 00:01:43.860
- Oh my gosh. That's amazing!

00:01:44.960 --> 00:01:46.550
- So like the farmer would come out,

00:01:46.550 --> 00:01:49.650
and be like, "(mumbling)
pig soldier, y'know,

00:01:49.650 --> 00:01:50.483
Lucy what's-it."

00:01:50.483 --> 00:01:51.960
And then he did like a,
"Here's Jennifer Love!"

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:54.110
And I would go out in
my little, like, y'know,

00:01:54.110 --> 00:01:56.690
cowboy boots and fringe
jacket that my mom had made,

00:01:56.690 --> 00:01:57.870
with the big hair.

00:01:57.870 --> 00:02:00.550
And yeah, I was like the
performer at Livestock shows.

00:02:00.550 --> 00:02:01.670
I did it for years.

00:02:01.670 --> 00:02:03.760
And then, y'know, like some, I don't know,

00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:05.070
fairs and stuff like that.

00:02:05.070 --> 00:02:05.990
It was great; I loved it.

00:02:05.990 --> 00:02:07.857
- Oh no, I did fairs too.

